=\"nhead\">板・売買フローの推定（AI）</div><div class=\"discnote\">この銘柄は本日の分析対象外です（今夜の厳選・出尽くしサイン・レーティング変化・注目開示などの注目銘柄のみ、毎晩の実行で場中の5分足を取得して分析します）。</div><div class=\"spwrap\"><div class=\"nhead\">値動きと長期支持帯<span class=\"spbtns\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '1')\">1年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn on\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '3')\">3年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '10')\">10年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, 'all')\">全期間(27年)</button></span></div><div class=\"spark spv\" data-sp=\"1\" style=\"display:none\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 110\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:100%; height:auto; background:#fffdf6; border-radius:8px;\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"77.8\" width=\"320\" height=\"12.799999999999997\" fill=\"#c62f2f\" opacity=\"0.12\"/><polyline points=\"4.0,97.2 9.1,89.4 14.2,79.4 19.3,80.1 24.5,65.9 29.6,82.4 34.7,77.9 39.8,67.9 44.9,66.2 50.0,76.1 55.1,72.3 60.3,73.1 65.4,61.2 70.5,54.8 75.6,56.9 80.7,37.8 85.8,21.2 91.0,26.2 96.1,20.9 101.2,17.7 106.3,12.8 111.4,17.7 116.5,22.3 121.6,33.2 126.8,19.8 131.9,29.4 137.0,31.7 142.1,45.1 147.2,59.1 152.3,63.9 157.4,50.7 162.6,58.7 167.7,55.1 172.8,65.4 177.9,67.6 183.0,73.8 188.1,70.5 193.2,73.7 198.4,74.2 203.5,78.1 208.6,82.2 213.7,76.8 218.8,81.2 223.9,77.4 229.0,71.7 234.2,73.8 239.3,83.7 244.4,82.0 249.5,81.8 254.6,78.7 259.7,75.1 264.9,77.4 270.0,72.0 275.1,65.8 280.2,73.6 285.3,78.1 290.4,80.8 295.5,80.3 300.7,76.3 305.8,66.3 310.9,62.2 316.0,74.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1c1c1e\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><path d=\"M 29.6 94.4 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 50.0 88.1 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 183.0 85.8 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 208.6 94.2 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 244.4 94.0 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 290.4 92.8 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><circle cx=\"316.0\" cy=\"74.0\" r=\"4\" f